cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Imprint, please cite it as below."
title: "Imprint: a portable working profile for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  One agent skill that carries how you work across agents. Imprint reads your
  conversations, encodes the recurring patterns as compact iLang structures,
  and applies them to memory, compression, onboarding, code review, debugging,
  planning, progress tracking, testing, git workflow and SEO. The profile is
  text, stored in your own repository, readable by a person and parseable by a
  machine, and it installs in any SKILL.md-compatible agent, among them Claude
  Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini, Hermes and Windsurf.
type: software
